{title: There's A Great Day Coming}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]There's a great day coming, a great day coming;
There's a great day coming by and [D]by,
When the [G]saints and the sinners shall be [C]parted right and [G]left,
Are you ready for that [D]day to [G]+come?

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Are you ready? Are you ready?
Are you ready for the judgment [D]day?
[G]Are you ready? Are you ready?
For the [D]judgment [G]day?

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]There's a bright day coming, a bright day coming;
There's a bright day coming by and [D]by.
But its [G]brightness shall only come to [C]them that love the [G]Lord.
Are you ready for that [D]day to [G]come?

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]There's a sad day coming, a sad day coming;
There's a sad day coming by and [D]by,
When the [G]sinner shall hear his doom: "[C]Depart, I know you [G]not!"
Are you ready for that [D]day to [G]come?
